    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) announced the supplementary SSC examinations results on August 7, 2007. The SSC examinations results were announced on July 5, 2007. Students, who took the supplementary examinations, now have their final verified college entry marks right at the beginning of the college enrolment season, and they will not lose any time in starting their Higher Secondary level studies.",
